  "structure": {
    "block_count": 11,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Your Pregnancy Week-by-Week",
        "text_sha256": "5af066b474b4078178436931c5b258b32d6627e606f0cff1088468729b73bd7e",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Wondering when you’ll feel your baby’s first kick or when you’ll have your first pregnancy ultrasound? Consider this week-by-week pregnancy calendar your ultimate guide to the next nine months.",
        "text_sha256": "d756fec823a65b348a80bd1aab433b5170d59de8f28858920536c117ffb46859",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Week-by-Week Pregnancy Calendar",
        "text_sha256": "2139783ba69f6b8dbb06a48d7ae8973e83f7603d6e82e31c4722354e9a2b091d",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "When you’re pregnant, your baby is changing every day, and your body is keeping pace. This pregnancy tracker will help you better understand the weeks, months, and trimesters of your pregnancy. Each brings new developments and milestones for you and your baby.",
        "text_sha256": "adae6cb4db55365a9d2a571afce94f29c9464720155abe37124b2b1d5ffb902c",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Read on to learn more about what you can expect to happen week-by-week during pregnancy, including how big your baby is each week, common early pregnancy symptoms you might experience, and, once you’ve entered the third trimester, ways to prepare for labor and signs that labor is near . You'll better understand what's going on and why, inside and out, with this guide.",
        "text_sha256": "c74790925aa1178fcde76ec80bc9c6dd4817f441c41ab427e5a220d6e6eb6d58",
        "word_count": 63
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "First Trimester",
        "text_sha256": "896b6f7a75bfb7aacd8f9c388bf586d999fba8b7f0ec18e3285c254985902243",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Second Trimester",
        "text_sha256": "b7fc038743ba3f5bfb4f0360254b054e0f48aad5b9b22480a51017acd3d28f4c",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Third Trimester",
        "text_sha256": "41bc18affe57749fa2fcbfaafc29b692ffb19660f9a5e990dea8556cf7a3f595",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Jump to Your Week of Pregnancy",
        "text_sha256": "92e57241f3a3f3bbb34cc8779211cc4afae4630d42d914f8cb621a8cb210ef95",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
